title: >-
  EEGSynthesizer: Reproducible Stochastic Parametric EEG Generator
  for Cross-Domain Seizure Detection Research

message: >-
  If you use this software, its generated datasets, or its validation
  results, please cite this record and the real EEG corpora listed below.

